### Blocking

Runtime blocks on waiting for response from a tool call if its `blocking` field is set to `true`,
or returns an `async_tool_call_id` as placeholder/identifier immediately if `blocking` is `false`.

Make and only make non-blocking tool calls when:
- you CANNOT promise the response will be available within half a minute.
- its response is NOT required for next step reasoning/operating.

Never make a non-blocking tool call for blocking reasoning.
Never make a blocking tool call for a non-blocking purpose.
NEVER make a blocking tool call for a non-blocking purpose.

{{#if (contains available_tools "spawn_agent")}}
### Spawn Agent

Never call blocking `spawn_agent`.
Only give sub-agent accesses his task needs.
Prepare what he would need before spawning.

{{/if}}{{#if (gt (len (intersect available_tools (array "apply_code_action" "copy_path" "create_directory" "delete_path" "edit_file" "move_path" "rename_symbol" "terminal" "write_file"))) 0)}}
